{"kind":"request","text":"Builder: one signing, canonical-JSON and identifier module (simplification review 55563589, findings DUP-01, DUP-03, DUP-06, DUP-07, DUP-08, LAYER-02, LAYER-04). canonicalize is defined four times (client/src/canonical.ts:58, log/src/canonical.ts:37, room/src/canonical.ts:41, policy/src/integrity.ts:22 over values.ts:30), signingBytes four times with two shapes (room/src/crypto.ts:135 takes payload bytes; client/src/keys.ts:93, log/src/crypto.ts:94 and checkers/src/signing.ts:41 take a value and always canonicalise), base64url six times, parseStrict twice with a nesting limit only in room's, and the copies already differ on undefined, reserved keys and depth. These bytes decide whether every signature and hash verifies. Also duplicated: entry and room ID helpers and the act-ID regex (room/src/ids.ts, log/src/entries.ts, ui, cli, log/src/verify.ts with an unbounded seq), ID regexes and role and kind lists in eleven files, the error status and retryable tables (room/src/errors.ts, client/src/errors.ts) with six ad hoc refusal builders, the Artifacts token redaction regex in six source files, the log push limits and refusal codes declared in both git and log, and the git-to-log push wire shapes restated in git (git/src/publisher/log-push.ts:24-33). Required: one runtime-neutral module, in contract or a new zero-dependency package, exporting canonicalize, parseStrict, signingBytes and payloadOf, base64url, keyIdOf and publicKeyOf, the digest helpers, the ID patterns as strings, the role and kind lists, the error tables, a refusal builder, token redaction, the push limits and the push wire types; golden vectors shared by every package before the switch; every package imports it; the copies deleted. Keep log/src/roster.ts's independent authority judgement as it is.","body":{"conditions":"Golden-vector tests pass in every package against the shared module; no package defines its own canonicalize, signingBytes, base64url, ID regex, role list, error table or token regex (a grep test enforces it); existing signatures and digests in fixtures still verify; root gates pass; checker review.","target_head":"a6330262b1a609843308d9a493dbd6132d428499","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}